   "hasTextLink": false
  },
  {
   "id": "543y3ijjDlyOUwBDQvNCS",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1065,
   "y": 900.0,
   "width": 341.0,
   "height": 250.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a005",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2112700330,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 698609854,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786830000000,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One row per position, database\ntype and move.\n\nWhen a database has nothing for\na position, a marker row is\nstored with the move name\n_EMPTY_ and zero games, so the\napp can tell \"nothing there\"\nfrom \"never asked\". Marker rows\nare filtered out on reading.",
   "rawText": "One row per position, database\ntype and move.\n\nWhen a database has nothing for\na position, a marker row is\nstored with the move name\n_EMPTY_ and zero games, so the\napp can tell \"nothing there\"\nfrom \"never asked\". Marker rows\nare filtered out on reading.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "eW8PnrYhpdNEbLuSk1eDK",
   "originalText": "One row per position, database\ntype and move.\n\nWhen a database has nothing for\na position, a marker row is\nstored with the move name\n_EMPTY_ and zero games, so the\napp can tell \"nothing there\"\nfrom \"never asked\". Marker rows\nare filtered out on reading.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
  {
   "id": "VZ2fq4XQJyAcAln0bW81v",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": -96,
   "y": 1570,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 440.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a006",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 513619832,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 120630110,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "kmTVNATYL90REWyRWQoaN"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1786830000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "hasTextLink": false
  },
  {
   "id": "kmTVNATYL90REWyRWQoaN",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -81,
   "y": 1590.0,
   "width": 363.0,
   "height": 400.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a007",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 925331499,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1091877900,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786830000000,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PGN is unique per repertoire, and\nin practice each node has one\nmove history.\n\nAfter a White move the generator\ntries to reuse an existing node\nby FEN, so that transpositions\nmerge into one node. That lookup\ncompares a full FEN against the\nshortened FENs stored here, so it\nnever matches: the merge branch\nnever runs and a new node is\nalways created.\n\nThe FEN stored here is the\nshortened one from FN.",
   "rawText": "PGN is unique per repertoire, and\nin practice each node has one\nmove history.\n\nAfter a White move the generator\ntries to reuse an existing node\nby FEN, so that transpositions\nmerge into one node. That lookup\ncompares a full FEN against the\nshortened FENs stored here, so it\nnever matches: the merge branch\nnever runs and a new node is\nalways created.\n\nThe FEN stored here is the\nshortened one from FN.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "VZ2fq4XQJyAcAln0bW81v",
   "originalText": "PGN is unique per repertoire, and\nin practice each node has one\nmove history.\n\nAfter a White move the generator\ntries to reuse an existing node\nby FEN, so that transpositions\nmerge into one node. That lookup\ncompares a full FEN against the\nshortened FENs stored here, so it\nnever matches: the merge branch\nnever runs and a new node is\nalways created.\n\nThe FEN stored here is the\nshortened one from FN.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
  {
   "id": "DNBhi736kApTfmO92vTTT",
