   "text": "DB.06 · RepertoireNode\n\nOne row represents\none specific position\nreached by one specific\nmove history in this\nrepertoire.\n\nStores:\n• id\n• FEN\n• PGN move history\n• cumulative probability\n• Amateur Trap flag\n• Master Threat flag",
   "rawText": "DB.06 · RepertoireNode\n\nOne row represents\none specific position\nreached by one specific\nmove history in this\nrepertoire.\n\nStores:\n• id\n• FEN\n• PGN move history\n• cumulative probability\n• Amateur Trap flag\n• Master Threat flag",
