   "updated": 1786845719945,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DB.07 · RepertoireMove\n\nOne row represents\none move between two\nRepertoireNodes.\n\nStores:\n• SAN move\n• from-node\n• to-node\n• whose move it is:\n  OPPONENT or RESPONSE\n\nFor opponent moves:\n• probability\n• true probability\n\nFor response moves:\n• weighted count\n• Lichess score\n• ChessDB score\n• engine source\n• deep-verified flag",
   "rawText": "DB.07 · RepertoireMove\n\nOne row represents\none move between two\nRepertoireNodes.\n\nStores:\n• SAN move\n• from-node\n• to-node\n• whose move it is:\n  OPPONENT or RESPONSE\n\nFor opponent moves:\n• probability\n• true probability\n\nFor response moves:\n• weighted count\n• Lichess score\n• ChessDB score\n• engine source\n• deep-verified flag",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
