   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "OpFT2zTW",
   "originalText": "DB.07 · RepertoireMove\n\nOne row represents\none move between two\nRepertoireNodes.\n\nStores:\n• SAN move\n• from-node\n• to-node\n• whose move it is:\n  OPPONENT or RESPONSE\n\nFor opponent moves:\n• probability\n• true probability\n\nFor response moves:\n• weighted count\n• Lichess score\n• ChessDB score\n• engine source\n• deep-verified flag",
