   "text": "DB.08 · RepertoirePositionStat\n\nStudy/review data for\na repertoire position.\n\nLinks to:\n• one Repertoire\n• one RepertoireNode\n• one target move\n\nStores:\n• explanation, if any\n• tags, if any\n• next review date\n• memory stability\n• difficulty\n• elapsed days\n• scheduled days\n• review count\n• lapse count\n• learning state\n• last review time\n• creation time",
   "rawText": "DB.08 · RepertoirePositionStat\n\nStudy/review data for\na repertoire position.\n\nLinks to:\n• one Repertoire\n• one RepertoireNode\n• one target move\n\nStores:\n• explanation, if any\n• tags, if any\n• next review date\n• memory stability\n• difficulty\n• elapsed days\n• scheduled days\n• review count\n• lapse count\n• learning state\n• last review time\n• creation time",
